		(property "Function" "OVLO divider bottom (1 %, P0-6): VOV = VOVLO(R) x (R408 + R409)/R409 = 1.20 V x 534.9k/64.9k = 9.89 V nominal; 9.43-10.28 V worst case with VOVLO(R) 1.17-1.22 V, 1 % resistors and +/-0.1 uA pin leakage (SLVSET8A 7.5, Eq.2); release (VOVLO(F) 1.08-1.13 V) >= 8.70 V. The minimum trip clears the 8.77 V PWM VSYS maximum (BQ25798 VSYSMAX_REG_ACC) and the about 9.05 V typ PFM level, given firmware PFM_FWD_DIS = 1 (BQ25798 REG0x12). Place at U402 pin 8."
			(at 38.1 102.87 0)
