		(property "Function" "EXP_VHP eFuse from VSYS (TPS259631, adjustable OVLO, auto-retry). RILM R410 1.50k -> ILIM 0.613 A (SLVSET8A Eq.5); OVLO R408/R409 470k/64.9k -> 9.89 V nominal, cut-off 9.43-10.28 V worst case (Eq.2, VOVLO 1.17-1.22 V, +/-0.1 uA leakage), release >= 8.70 V; CdVdt C405 47 nF -> 0.89 V/ms (Eq.4), 9.4 ms to 8.4 V, about 51 mA into 57 uF. EXP_VHP follows VSYS (about 9.1 V max in normal use: 8.77 V PWM max, about 9.05 V typ in PFM), so shield inputs must be rated >= 12 V; firmware sets BQ25798 PFM_FWD_DIS = 1 (REG0x12) at init. EN/UVLO driven only by EXP_VHP_EN. Place on F.Cu near the bay edge by J11 pins 19-22, PowerPAD with thermal vias to GND."
			(at 71.12 91.44 0)
			(hide yes)
			(show_name no)
			(do_not_autoplace no)
			(effects
				(font
