		(property "Function" "ESD for J11 pins 6/8/10/14 (EXP_TMR0, EXP_TMR_IN, EXP_TMR1, EXP_INT0_N). 4-ch 0.5 pF array, no VCC pin (no back-power path); pad-to-pad <=3 mm from J11 on B.Cu, GND pins straight to the GND plane. NC pins tied to the facing IO channel for straight-through routing (SLVSBO7O Table 4-2 p.4, Fig. 4-3; P1-27): 10 = INT0_N, 9 = TMR1, 7 = TMR_IN, 6 = TMR0."
			(at 240.03 116.84 0)
