		(property "Function" "330R x4 series (edge rate / injection limit) for the J11 even-row group behind D405; element k sits between pins k and 9-k (UNI-ROYAL JLC-01-015 sec. 3.1): R1 EXP_INT1_N (PD10 EXTI10, J11.16), R2 EXP_IO0 (PE1, J11.26), R3 EXP_IO1 (PE0, J11.28), R4 EXP_DETECT_N (PB4, J11.32). J11-side pins 8/7/6/5 face the D405 NC pads 6/7/9/10 (flow-through); B.Cu north of D405. Replaces R428/R429/R430/R432 (S-22)."
