		(property "Function" "EXP_INT0_N 10k pull-up to +3V3_EXP on the J11 side of R426 (P1-26 / EXP-06): defined idle level for an open-drain shield interrupt; on the switched shield rail, so an unpowered shield is never back-powered. Firmware: keep PD9 analog or EXTI9 masked until +3V3_EXP is on and settled, mask again before switching it off; never enable the PD9 internal pull-up while the rail is off. B.Cu in-line on the D404 NC pad 10 -> R426 flow-through, via-in-pad to +3V3_EXP."
